@startuml
title FOC Controller Block Diagram
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Controller" as Controller

component "vd_ref, vq_ref\n(rotor_angle)" as refs
component "inverse_park()\n-> valpha, vbeta" as park
component "inverse_clarke()\n-> phase_a, phase_b, phase_c" as clarke
component "run_bldc_motor_simulation()\n(netlist: ltspice/motor_model.cir)\nwrites: phaseA.csv/B/C" as sim
component "LTSpice model\nltspice/motor_model.cir" as ltspice
component "ia, ib, ic\n(from .raw)" as currents
component "abc_to_alpha_beta()\n-> alpha, beta" as abc2ab
component "alpha_beta_to_dq()\n-> id, iq\n(rotor_angle_sim)" as ab2dq
component "PI current controller\n-> vd_ref, vq_ref" as control

refs --> park : vd_ref, vq_ref\n(rotor_angle)
park --> clarke : valpha, vbeta
clarke --> sim : phase_a, phase_b, phase_c\n(phaseA.csv, phaseB.csv, phaseC.csv)
sim --> ltspice : run netlist (calls LTSpice)
ltspice --> currents : ia, ib, ic (raw)
currents --> abc2ab
abc2ab --> ab2dq : alpha, beta
ab2dq --> control : id, iq
control --> refs : updated vd_ref, vq_ref
sim --> ab2dq : rotor_angle_sim

note right of park
  Implementation: src/main.py -> inverse_park()
end note
note right of clarke
  Implementation: src/main.py -> inverse_clarke()
end note
note right of sim
  Implementation: src/ltspice_driver.py -> run_bldc_motor_simulation(), write_pwl(), get_ltspice_command()
  Netlist: ltspice/motor_model.cir
  CSV inputs: ltspice/phaseA.csv, phaseB.csv, phaseC.csv
end note
note right of ab2dq
  Implementation: src/main.py -> abc_to_alpha_beta(), alpha_beta_to_dq()
  Outputs: id_current, iq_current
end note
note right of control
  Implementation: src/main.py -> PI control update of vd_ref and vq_ref
  Uses latest segment current error to correct next segment
end note

footer
Generate diagram: plantuml doc/foc_controller.puml
Outputs: foc_controller.png (or use online PlantUML)
end footer
@enduml
